 "posts": [
  "POWER ADVISORY: CANCELLATION OF SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION ON OCTOBER 15, 2026\nTo our valued consumers,\nPlease be informed that the scheduled power interruption affecting a Portion of AF2 - Portion of Salazar Street, Brgy. Alijis, Bacolod City, on October 15, 2026 (Thursday) has been Cancelled due to necessary adjustments in the scheduled date. This decision was made to accommodate operational requirements and ensure a more efficient execution of maintenance activities.\nThank you for your kind understanding and continued cooperation as we work to serve you better.",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: OCTOBER 15, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa October 15, 2026 (Thursday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: October 15, 2026 (Thursday)\nReason: Conversion from single phase to three phase wire.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n7:00AM to 5:00PM\nPortion of AF2 - Portion of Salazar Street, Brgy. Alijis, Bacolod City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
